# Origin, not GitHub

This repo is **Cursor Origin** (`fidelis/resume-website`). GitHub (`afanasyevbot/resume-website`) is backup only.

- Branch, commit, push, open PRs, and merge on **Origin**.
- Ship `mafanasiev.me` by pushing `main` to the Origin remote (`cursor-origin`), not by merging on GitHub.
- Do **not** open GitHub PRs or treat GitHub `main` as production.
- Remote `origin` may still point at GitHub in some checkouts — use `cursor-origin` / `https://origin.cursor.com/fidelis/resume-website.git` for real work.
